Z||000003||FieroLisa||12-02-2001||12:52 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Uaana:<BR><B>considering how many of us are suffering from little dick syndrome.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hmmm I think *I* suffer from no-dick syndrome...it's OK, I can compensate in other areas  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>BUT I do completely agree with you. Fieros are not the hands-down best cars in the world, we just think they are. So that entitles everyone to think the same thing about their own make/model.   And like I said in another post with the same topic, if everyone loved and collected Fieros, we wouldn't be able to buy them off the side of the road for $300, so chill out and enjoy your ride everyone!!!<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/fierolisa.gif">       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A>*<A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>NC Tarheels Fieros Site</A><P>AIM: FieroLisa||||reg||1
