Z||000009||Spektrum-87GT||12-02-2001||09:25 PM||||well, we've gotta defend the fiero! there was a lot of bad press about it and a lot of false rumors... so long live the protectors of the fiero!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/spektrum_87gt/" TARGET=_blank>87 Fiero GT</A><BR>1991 Jeep Cherokee<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://members.home.com/bspracklin1/sig2.jpg">   <BR>AIM:<FONT COLOR="red">S</FONT><FONT COLOR="purple">p</FONT><FONT COLOR="blue">e</FONT><FONT COLOR="cyan">k</FONT><FONT COLOR="green">t</FONT><FONT COLOR="yellow">r</FONT><FONT COLOR="orange">u</FONT><FONT COLOR="red">m</FONT><FONT COLOR="purple">1</FONT><FONT COLOR="blue">1</FONT><FONT COLOR="cyan">7</FONT><BR>And no! i'm not gay dangit!||||reg||1
Z||000010||84Bill||12-03-2001||10:37 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroLisa:<BR><B> Hmmm I think *I* suffer from no-dick syndrome...it's OK, I can compensate in other areas   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>PERK!<BR>Perhaps I may be able to aid it rectifying the aformentiond problem by supplying the required equipment for said syndrome.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR>Did I just post that!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_drunk.gif">||||reg||6
Z||000011||Turbo88||12-03-2001||01:14 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Spektrum-87GT:<BR><B>well, we've gotta defend the fiero! there was a lot of bad press about it and a lot of false rumors... so long live the protectors of the fiero!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I love the fact that everyone outside of the Fiero world gives em no respect. I sold my LS1 FBody and decided to build my 88 Formula for that very reason! The Fiero is the ultimate "sleeper hiding in the crowd" car. You can really tune and tweek and mod your car and it will look like a damn F1 car if you want it to. You could show them a blown and injected RAT motor in the back of one with 315/40/18s on the back and people will still not respect you. I LOVE IT!!!! Most people build sleeper cars by taking an poor looking yet normally powerful car and building it up. Most people pull up next to a 75 Camaro covered with rust and be willing to challenge them true. But add a huge lope that exhaust and let the torque converter slip to 4k before the car start to move and you know it's a sleeper. Package that same thing into a fiero and even the damn all rice civics will race you! Easiest money you will ever make. <P>That being said, I'm fine with the catch on fire comments and peice of crap comments. My simple anwser is, let's head out to the track or deserted road and see what it's all about? Oh and, bring your wallet with you and I don't except checks!<P>Just my .02..<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
